Z||000010||Ed||04-27-2000||08:54 PM||||Well, I just yesterday received my Mr. Mike's seat kit.  'Bout ready to put them on.<P>I got them because of people on this forum recommending them, and also two local people who have them.   <P>I've also seen installed PISA seat covers and they looked good too.||||reg||1
Z||000011||Oreif||04-28-2000||01:18 AM||||The seats in my car were $380 for the seats (2-tone is no charge) + $20 for the Black stripe (called the GT stripe by Mr.Mikes) and $20 for the Fiero logo. The only other option is speaker holes but I didn't need them for my '86. If you need them they are $30 more. So my total cost for both seats was $420. Mr.Mike's has 3 more styles at varing prices. For more info check out his website at:   <A HREF="http://www.mrmikes.com" TARGET=_blank>www.mrmikes.com</A> <P><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 04-28-2000).]||||reg||6
